        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "description": "A domain is graded on six things: the bare domain, www, its nameservers, its mail servers, whether it actually answers over IPv6, and whether the page's own assets do. Nameservers run far ahead of everything else.",
      "datasource": {
